SERVICES

Hardware

All the AlphaServer 2000 systems have a three-year onsite,
five-day-per-week, nine-hour-per-day hardware warranty, with
next-business-day response time. This warranty may be upgraded to provide
higher levels of support. The full range of Digital service options is
available for these systems.

Software

The warranty for all three operating systems, as well as NAS, is 90 days,
with conformance to SPD and advisory telephone support. This warranty may be
upgraded to provide higher levels of support.

