New DB Integrator V3.1a Packaging

HIGHLIGHTS

*  DB Integrator Development, Interactive, and Runtime products consolidated
   into one package (DB Integrator Server V3.1a multidatabase manager)
*  Concurrent use license checking problem rectified with this version

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

DB Integrator V3.1a manager consolidates DB Integrator Development, DB
Integrator Interactive, and DB Integrator Runtime into a single user
package.  DB Integrator V3.1a is Digital's data integration software
framework for distributed enterprise wide data integration.  It offers the
capability to create a single virtual database from multiple databases.  DB
Integrator V3.1a is one of the products in Digital's ACCESSWORKS family of
database access and integration products.

BENEFITS

The consolidation of DB Integrator license types into a single DB Integrator
Server V3.1a package simplifies ordering by eliminating the confusion about
when to order what license type.

This new version also rectifies concurrent use checking problems from the
previous version. In the past, DB Integrator concurrent use licenses were
counted by the number of DB Integrator processes created on the server,
since it was anticipated that one client would use one server process.
However, since some PC client applications use multiple processes, users who
purchased a single user license would receive error messages with only one
client attached. The LMF license check has been modified to only count one
user on a client as a single concurrent user, regardless of the number of
processes it creates on the server.

Users must purchase the DEC SQL Development product separately. This allows
users to purchase DEC SQL Development with a DB Integrator Gateway without
having to purchase DB Integrator.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

