PROBEwatch V3.2 and DECpacketprobe Upgrades

HIGHLIGHTS

*  Increased functionality, including comparison of traffic on multiple
   segments and report generation
*  More technologies supported: Token Ring, FDDI, and WAN, in addition to
   Ethernet
*  New support for Digital UNIX, in addition to Windows

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

PROBEwatch software and DECpacketprobe firmware provide a complete solution
that helps users keep precise tabs on network activity across widely
dispersed LANs. With this powerful combination of products, users get the
most extensive and versatile capabilities available today to maximize
network availability and optimize resource utilization. In addition
PROBEwatch is compatible with Frontier Software Development's probes.

New features of PROBEwatch V3.2 include the capability of launching NetView,
ManageWORKS, and HUBwatch from POLYCENTER software. In addition, PROBEwatch
can now display host statistics by host name or by address. New
DECpacketprobe features include the capability to report by IP address, as
well as Mac address.

BENEFITS

*  Increased productivity -- PROBEwatch allows users to quickly isolate
   problems by comparing traffic on multiple segments. Also, captured data
   can be sorted and printed out to analyze problem areas. DECpacketprobe
   allows users to monitor segments when the network is down using SLIP
   out-of-band port. Domains are automatically reloaded after power loss.
*  Better return on investment -- One copy of PROBEwatch can monitor and
   analyze Token Ring, FDDI, and WAN networks, in addition to Ethernet.
   Digital supplies the Ethernet and Token Ring probes, and PROBEwatch can
   also read Frontier Software Development's WAN and FDDI probes.
*  Investment protection  PROBEwatch is easily customizable to monitor new
   applications and protocols

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

PROBEwatch for Windows V3.2, PROBEwatch V3.2 for Digital UNIX (formerly
called DEC OSF/1), and DECpacketprobe firmware upgrades are available now.

An Update License is required for each DECpacketprobe update. One license is
included in QB packages (QB-219AA-SB and QB-21AAA-SB). One license
(QM-219AA-AA or QM-21AAA-AA) must be ordered for each additional probe.

