RSX-11M-PLUS V4.5 and Micro/RSX V4.5 operating systems bring new
functionality to the RSX family of products for PDP-11 systems. Version 4.5
is the first release of the operating systems from Mentec, Inc., since the
transfer of the PDP-11 software from Digital to Mentec in March 1994.
Digital and Mentec continue their commitment to provide ongoing support for
