o  Flexibility -- Systems can be designed to meet any configuration
   requirement in a choice of 19-inch wide cabinet heights to meet unique
   applicatian needs.

o  Investment protection -- The AlphaStation 600 was designed to accept
   future faster processors through easy system upgrades.

