THREE-PHASE UPS CONFIGURATIONS FOR ALPHASERVER 8200 AND 8400
SYSTEMS

Uninterrupted power supply (UPS) systems for AlphaServer 8200 and 8400
systems have the following limitations:

*  A 3-phase UPS system can handle equipment requiring both single and
   3-phase power. However, a single-phase UPS can only serve equipment
   requiring single-phase power.

*  The SW800 is a storage array requiring 3-phase power and any system used
   with it requires a 3-phase UPS. Use all UPS products with a data line
   surge protector.

